  "title": "Stuffed Artichokes",
  "description": "A stuffing made with Italian bread, garlic, parsley, Romano cheese and oregano is stuffed between the leaves of whole artichokes. The stuffed artichokes are then simmered slowly for an hour.",
  "authors": [
    "Michele O'Sullivan"
  ],
